FunASR Paraformer-Large 模型文件:
  funasr/paraformer_nano.onnx   INT8量化模型 (~228MB)
  funasr/tokens.json            Byte-level BPE tokens (8404)
  funasr/cmvn_mean.bin          CMVN 均值 (2240 bytes, 560 floats)
  funasr/cmvn_invstd.bin        CMVN inverse std (2240 bytes, 560 floats)

下载: python scripts/setup_funasr_model.py
转换CMVN: python scripts/convert_cmvn.py
